  "_about": ["mhai-web's audit vocabulary, as its audit screens accept it (Plan 4 spec 5.3). Copied by hand from the commit below; never edited here except to re-copy.", "types: AUDIT_TYPES (audit-contract.ts). kinds: KINDS (kinds.ts), each with its type, the target kinds it may name and whether it may carry a note.", "facts and filters: AuditFacts and RecordedFilters (audit-contract.ts) with the shapes read.ts checks (isFacts, isFilters).", "pending_in_web: kinds this backend sends that mhai-web has not shipped yet; until it does, those entries show as undisplayable. Remove the list once mhai-web ships them (Plan 4 Task 14, TODO.md).", "Spec 5.3 marks seven kinds new; audit_undisplayable_reported is already in mhai-web at this commit, so six are pending."],
